Error [E0384]: Jet has no membership operator here; `in` only joins a source-loop binding to its source.
  --> tests/ui/in_membership_retired.jet:2:16
    |
  2 |     found :: x in xs
    |                ^^
 Why: expression `x in xs` has no operator meaning in Jet. Collection membership is a method call.
 Fix: write `xs.contains(x)` (the `.contains(x)` method) instead of `x in xs`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0384
